</div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shock</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/461175-male-uratha-pregnancy?p=461900#post461900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Kinda wondering where Gaia fits into the whole mess.<br /> <br /> Helios, Luna, and the like are all Awakened spirits and yet no real answer on how Gaia fits in.<br /> <br /> Of course, that line of thought triggers Werewolf: the Apocalypse in people but in the Forsaken context, it does make you wonder just what the planet is up to.<br /> <br /> It might just be playing the long game and doesn't feel the need to be as involved as her sisters/brothers. As the saying goes, the Earth will continue. We are not so certain.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Gaia died around the Industrial Revolution. Don't ask what replaced her . . . <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1904"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-30T07:50:30-07:00","id":462249,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>branford</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-worl